release/release-notes-*.md

# Generated brand assets. Every consumer regenerates them before use (scripts/package-app.sh,
# scripts/launch-dev-app.sh both run the generators first), so tracking them bought nothing and
# cost a dirty tree on every build: Pillow writes byte-different PNGs across encoder versions,
# and scripts/release.sh refuses to run on a dirty tree. Listed by path, never as bare globs —
# `*.png` here would swallow app-icon-v6.png and Source/logo.png, the hand-made inputs the
# generators read from. See docs/fork-sync.md: upstream tracks these, so a merge re-adds them.
Assets/Brand/AppIcon.appiconset/
Assets/Brand/DevIsland.iconset/
Assets/Brand/Internal/
Assets/Brand/DevIsland.icns
Assets/Brand/dmg-background.png
Assets/Brand/dmg-background@2x.png
Assets/Brand/scout-app-icon-master.svg

# Local tooling artifacts
.venv/
.claude/
.playwright-mcp/
output/

